LICENCE RULE (owner, 2026-10-04) — applies to every file in this folder
------------------------------------------------------------------------
* Code that defines, creates or renders HARDWARE (OpenSCAD, KiCad files and
  scripts, FreeCAD, Blender, G-code/slicer profiles, and tools that write or
  render meshes/CAD/PCB) — CERN-OHL-W 2.0 (SPDX: CERN-OHL-W-2.0),
  ../LICENSES/CERN-OHL-W 2.0.
* Code whose end result is SOFTWARE or FIRMWARE (firmware, device trees, ground
  software, analysis/verification/CI tools) — MIT (SPDX: MIT), ../LICENSES/MIT.
* DOCUMENTS (Markdown, text, SVG/figures, specifications) — CC BY-SA 4.0
  (SPDX: CC-BY-SA-4.0), ../LICENSES/CC-BY-SA 4.0.
Third-party material keeps its own licence (see REFERENCES.md and
docs/attribution_and_licensing.md). Each file's header names its licence.
